{"id":"shammah","name":"Shammah","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:shammah"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Shammah","text":"Desert. (1.) One of the “dukes” of Edom (Gen. 36:13, 17). (2.) One of the sons of Jesse (1 Sam. 16:9). He is also called Shimeah (2 Sam. 13:3) and Shimma (1 Chr. 2:13). (3.) One of David’s three mighty men (2 Sam. 23:11, 12). (4.) One of David’s mighties (2 Sam. 23:25); called also Shammoth (1 Chr. 11:27) and Shamhuth (27:8)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H8048","lemma":"שַׁמָּה","xlit":"Shammâh","gloss":"Shammah, the name of an Edomite and four Israelites","kjv":"Shammah","count":8,"share":0.53},{"strong":"H251","lemma":"אָח","xlit":"ʼâch","gloss":"a brother )","kjv":"another, brother; kindred, like, other","count":4,"share":0.27},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":10,"share":0.67},{"strong":"H5221","lemma":"נָכָה","xlit":"nâkâh","gloss":"to strike","kjv":"beat, cast forth, clap, give","count":3,"share":0.2}],"verses":["Gen.36.13","Gen.36.17","1Sam.16.9","1Sam.17.13","2Sam.23.11","2Sam.23.25","2Sam.23.33","1Chr.1.37","2Sam.13.3","2Sam.13.32","2Sam.21.21","2Sam.23.12","1Chr.2.13","1Chr.11.27","1Chr.20.7"],"related":[{"id":"mizzah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.2,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"nahath","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.158,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"reuel","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.12,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"zerah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.107,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"jesse","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.053,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"asahel","type":"lexical","strong":"H251","why":"both lead with אָח (H251)"},{"id":"azareel","type":"lexical","strong":"H251","why":"both lead with אָח (H251)"},{"id":"bethuel","type":"lexical","strong":"H